            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cathy Adams-Kane"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I could not get ground lamb from my meat dept. so i used 1/2 lb. ground turkey and 1/2 lb lean ground beef. Other than that I followed the recipe it was fantastic! Even my hubby and kids liked it.A nice change to a plain burger!",
            "datePublished": "2010-08-22T15:33:48.073Z"
          },
